# SLICE-02 "The wall collapses, dust and smoke" (UE Chaos Destruction + Niagara): Starter's Wall (300 x 200 x 40 cm,
# Fractures/Wall.dfrac: 2 Uniform levels, cut from Meshes/Modeling/Wall.stmesh by SLICE-02_bake.scn) is broken at
# t = 1 s by WallBlast, a Radial Impulse Field at the wall's centre fired from gameplay (FireFieldAfter.lua ->
# Destruction.applyField, UE ApplyPhysicsField). The wall's breaks / collisions / removals reach its script
# (DestructionDust.lua, UE OnChaosBreakEvent / OnChaosPhysicsCollision / OnChaosRemovalEvent), which writes them
# into the VFX data channels BreakDust / ImpactDust / SettleDust (UE: write to a Niagara Data Channel); WallDust's
# emitters (VFX/WallDust.dfx: BreakDust, BreakSmoke, BreakSparks, LandingDust) spawn from those entries at the
# break and landing points. The scenario does not save the scene.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene Starter.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -100,200,-250
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.53,-0.2,0.82
Когда run Action Simulate
Когда advance 0.9
Тогда-вид 0_intact the wall standing whole (left of centre, beside the glass sphere), no particles around it
Когда advance 0.4
Тогда-вид 1_break the wall's pieces flying apart from its centre, orange sparks and a tan dust burst at the break points
Когда advance 1.5
Когда advance 1.2
Тогда-вид 2_settle the pieces lying on the ground where the wall stood, a dust and grey smoke cloud hanging over them
Когда run Action Stop
